# Joveo Dashboard Metadata Standards

## Overview
This rule ensures all Joveo dashboard applications include comprehensive metadata for SEO optimization, social sharing, and app store listings.

## Required Metadata

### HTML Head Metadata
- **Title**: Clear, concise title describing the dashboard functionality
- **Description**: 150-160 character summary of dashboard purpose and key features
- **Canonical URL**: Proper canonical URL to prevent duplicate content issues
- **Viewport**: Responsive configuration for all devices
- **Character Encoding**: UTF-8 encoding

### Open Graph Protocol
- **og:title**: Dashboard title (matches HTML title)
- **og:description**: Dashboard description
- **og:type**: "website"
- **og:url**: Canonical URL to the dashboard
- **og:image**: High-quality thumbnail representing the dashboard (1200×630px)
- **og:site_name**: "Joveo Dashboard"

### Twitter Cards
- **twitter:card**: "summary_large_image"
- **twitter:title**: Dashboard title
- **twitter:description**: Dashboard description
- **twitter:image**: High-quality dashboard thumbnail

### App Manifest
- **name**: Full dashboard name
- **short_name**: Abbreviated dashboard name
- **description**: Dashboard purpose and functionality
- **start_url**: Entry point URL
- **display**: "standalone"
- **background_color**: "#FFFFFF"
- **theme_color**: "#1C2536" (Joveo dark navy)

## Implementation Pattern

```typescript
// In your Next.js layout.tsx file:
export const metadata = {
  title: "Dashboard Name | Joveo",
  description: "Concise description of dashboard functionality and value proposition.",
  metadataBase: new URL("https://dashboard.joveo.com"),
  alternates: {
    canonical: "/dashboard-path",
  },
  openGraph: {
    type: "website",
    title: "Dashboard Name | Joveo",
    description: "Concise description of dashboard functionality and value proposition.",
    url: "https://dashboard.joveo.com/dashboard-path",
    siteName: "Joveo Dashboard",
    images: [
      {
        url: "https://dashboard.joveo.com/images/dashboard-thumbnail.jpg",
        width: 1200,
        height: 630,
      }
    ],
  },
  twitter: {
    card: "summary_large_image",
    title: "Dashboard Name | Joveo",
    description: "Concise description of dashboard functionality and value proposition.",
    images: ["https://dashboard.joveo.com/images/dashboard-thumbnail.jpg"],
  },
};
```

