```

## Enforcement Rules

### Required
- Complete metadata in all dashboard applications
- SEO-optimized descriptions between 150-160 characters
- Properly sized social media thumbnail images
- Canonical URLs to prevent duplicate content
- Responsive viewport settings

### Forbidden
- Missing or generic metadata
- Descriptions exceeding 160 characters
- Low-quality or missing social thumbnail images
- Missing canonical URLs
- Hardcoded absolute URLs without environment variables

## Compliance Checklist
- [ ] HTML title and meta description tags
- [ ] Open Graph tags
- [ ] Twitter Card tags
- [ ] Web app manifest
- [ ] Favicon and app icons
- [ ] Canonical URL